WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:05.190
Time Remaining

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:14.160
Mock Exam

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.410
Section 2 -     Answer the following (A-C) [44 points]

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.410
A   Choose the most appropriate phrase to fill in the blanks 
in the following sentences.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.410
Q1)

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.550
Stop, Papika! Get back here!

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.630
But this was another bust.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.270
So I'll go by myself!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.960
Looking for a candidate on 
foot is highly inefficient.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.270
<i>Like I care!</i>

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.400
Dr. Salt?

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:55.740
Stop

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:58.400
Thanks for the welcome!

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.540
See you later!

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.350
Brr! It's cold!

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:30.480
Whoa, look at the bright lights!

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:32.850
Yahoo!

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:19.130
Who are you?

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:23.680
Welcome back.

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.440
Good morning, Cocona.

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:36.440
Good morning.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.450
What's the matter?

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:44.160
Did you have a bad dream?

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.010
Nah.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.580
Were you up late reading again?

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.840
Where should I go?

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:05.120
Hmm?

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:09.720
Never mind.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.200
I'm off.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:58.960
Cocona!

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:01.030
We can still make the train!

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:12.820
Cocona...

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:17.120
A chimney?

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:18.270
Stupid.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.220
You still can't decide?

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:29.760
I don't know which is the best choice.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:31.510
Excuse me.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:34.020
Oh, Cocona.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:35.970
You got called to the office?

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.810
Our choices for the mock exams

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.510
are due by the end of today.

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:42.780
I'd forgotten about that.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:44.920
What a pain.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:53.540
<i>Just write down where you want to go,</i>

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:56.290
<i>be it a place where you can 
work toward your dream job</i>

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:59.790
<i>or a school where you can 
indulge in your hobbies.</i>

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.540
<i>Some even pick the school 
that's closest to home.</i>

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:05.420
<i>Any reason is fine.</i>

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.940
You still can't decide?

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:23.560
What's the big deal? 
You could get in anywhere.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.830
I don't want to go just "anywhere."

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:28.400
That's my list.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.030
I'll use it as a reference.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.820
Thank you, Cocona-san.

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:37.110
Sorry to make you do this
when you're not on duty.

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:39.540
It's okay. You have one patient.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.250
Where are you going?

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:43.460
Somewhere I can concentrate.

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:46.080
Excuse me.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.400
Goodbye.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:53.010
Go home if you're feeling sick.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:54.510
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:02.110
Want to check out that shop by the station?

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.710
A storage space?

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:42.020
Uh, that's a boys' school.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:44.900
Take this seriously, Yayaka.

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:48.480
What am I going to do?

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:55.070
Found you!

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:57.450
You're the girl from this morning...

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:00.120
Hey, what are you doing?

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:02.930
I could ask the same of you. 
What are you doing here?

00:08:02.930 --> 00:08:04.030
I was sleeping.

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:06.210
You took so long to show up, Cocona.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:06.730
Wha—

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.460
I waited forever for you.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:10.210
Sniff...

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.060
Sniff, sniff, sniff.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:14.400
Wh-What's with you? Who are you?!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:16.530
Papika.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:18.940
Papika?

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.230
Let's go together!

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:29.100
Where?

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.560
Er...

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:33.140
P-Puey? Pew?

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:34.240
What was it, again?

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.860
Pure Illusion.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.310
TT392 has secured Papika.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:53.630
Is that a partner candidate?

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:55.980
Put them to the test.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.140
Palpation time!

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.470
Try sending them over!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:02.770
Touch

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.970
S-Stop it!

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:09.980
Hey!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.120
Stop!

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:15.530
No!

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.530
Please, don't!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.470
You're alive!

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:39.580
Stop it!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.220
Where are we?

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:45.660
Not inside the pipe?

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:46.730
Look there.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.320
An exit?

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:51.480
Let's go check.

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:13.130
Cocona!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.120
Awesome!

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:27.810
It's a white world!

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:31.190
This is totally awesome!

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:30.460
No way.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:32.300
How?

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.480
So awesome!

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:34.900
Where is everyone?

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:37.440
Where did the school go?

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.510
This is Pure Illusion.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:42.780
Welcome to Pure Illusion.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:44.140
Pure Illusion?

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:45.710
Cocona!

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:50.790
Amazing! We made it!

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:53.630
We made it!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.460
Wanna see what's over there?

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.450
Let's go.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:01.990
Wait!

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:06.960
Hup!

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:20.780
Search

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:27.450
Grandma

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:27.700
Grandma

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.830
Grandma

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.830
No Signal

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:31.850
Is this a dream?

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:36.400
I've heard of lucid dreams before...

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:39.400
Join us, Cocona!

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.360
You're gonna...

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:53.720
You klutz!

00:11:57.630 --> 00:11:58.660
It's sweet...

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:00.690
What's sweet?

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:01.740
The snow.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.120
You'll get an upset stomach.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:07.990
It is sweet!

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.540
Really sweet.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:14.430
Yeah.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:18.480
Why, you little...

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:20.480
Come on, Cocona.

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:22.240
Hold it!

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:49.230
What are those, Cocona?

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:50.880
Ghosts?

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:56.950
Frosted trees?

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:58.040
Frost... what?

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:01.470
They're formed by the wind 
blowing ice into trees.

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:03.050
Wow...

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.430
I've never seen one before.

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:06.710
Let's go take a closer look.

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:32.120
Hey! I was using those as markers!

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:34.120
They're yummy!

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:37.750
Snow?

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.540
Let's make a place to sleep, Cocona.

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.500
We're sleeping here?

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.790
Hurry up!

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:45.230
It'll be nighttime soon!

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:51.810
Cocona! Cocona!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.560
Look, look!

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:56.380
Cocona?

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.930
What is this place, really?

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:03.870
Everyone's just hiding from us, right?

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:09.060
It's okay.

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:10.570
What is?

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:15.330
Aren't you scared?

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:19.780
Nah. You're here with me.

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:23.940
And Bu-chan's here, too.

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:28.350
Let's go on a treasure hunt tomorrow, Cocona.

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:29.840
Treasure hunt?

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.270
It's somewhere out here in Pure Illusion.

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:34.350
Something that can make wishes come true.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:36.560
Also, it smells nice.

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:39.060
Smells nice? Like, food?

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:41.770
It smells like you.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:42.920
You're too close!

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:50.490
What's going on?

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:55.740
Go take a look.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.250
Bu-chan!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.430
Um, uh...

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:13.660
What do we do?

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:14.750
Don't ask me.

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:32.660
It's a frosted tree.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.740
Awaken

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:39.460
He came back to life.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.170
My glasses are gone.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.510
Glasses?

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:45.250
Did I drop them somewhere?

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.010
Your glasses!

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:53.490
It took them.

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.770
Oh, no...

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:00.390
Got it.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:01.560
Hold on tight.

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:09.360
Glasses, glasses...

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:11.610
Found them!

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:22.460
This is hard.

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.460
Hey! Do you want to die?!

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:26.570
I'm just going to get your glasses back.

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:29.700
But it'll be hard to find 
them if they get in there.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:30.460
What is that?

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:41.470
Bu-chan!

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:47.230
Wait here.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:47.230
No!

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:48.680
Wait!

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:54.070
Hup.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.680
O-Ow...

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:17.010
Th-This is nothing...

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.470
That's enough!

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:19.720
Forget the glasses!

00:17:20.090 --> 00:17:21.960
I don't need them! Just get back here!

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:34.780
Stop it! You'll die!

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.160
Just get back, hurry!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:37.780
Just...

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:41.030
a little more...

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:20.550
Come on... Why did you do that?

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:24.040
I told you I didn't need them.

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:25.840
Papika...

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:29.530
Papika.

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:36.140
Papika!

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:25.240
You idiot.

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:30.640
Cocona?

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.590
Papika.

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:35.650
Look, I found them.

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:41.770
They're cracked a bit.

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:45.660
Wow, Cocona!

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:47.360
Is it really you, Cocona?

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:48.870
How?

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:49.900
How? How?!

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:51.580
S-Stop it! What's gotten into you?

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:53.360
You look awesome!

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:54.780
How'd you get like that?

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.560
What the heck?!

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.260
Lucky you.

00:19:58.560 --> 00:19:59.680
No! Why?

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:01.290
Why? Why?!

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:27.080
What is this?

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:30.380
It's warm.

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:45.470
Cocona.

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:58.020
Let's go adventuring again, okay?

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:05.540
Uh, no.

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:37.630
What? Why not?!

00:22:37.630 --> 00:22:39.040
Let's go!

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:40.340
No, thank you!

00:22:40.740 --> 00:22:42.810
What was that earlier?

00:22:42.810 --> 00:22:44.050
You mean Pure Illusion?

00:22:44.410 --> 00:22:45.520
Was it a dream?

00:22:45.520 --> 00:22:47.920
Or, like, another dimension 
or a parallel world?

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:49.620
Parallel?

00:22:50.630 --> 00:22:52.660
Cocona, what's that in your hand?

00:22:54.900 --> 00:22:55.700
This?

00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:03.550
A fragment was brought back?

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:06.410
Sniff, sniff.

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:08.440
You think this is the...

00:23:14.340 --> 00:23:16.120
Ow...

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:17.370
Papika!

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:21.100
Cocona!

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:24.460
Cocona! Cocona!

00:23:24.790 --> 00:23:25.930
Cocona!

00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:27.980
Cocona!

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:32.600
Next time on <i>Flip Flappers:</i>

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:33.010
"Pure—

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:35.390
Cocona! Let's go adventuring together!

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:36.850
Hey! Don't interrupt me!

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:39.850
Pure Converter

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:38.310
Next time, "Pure—

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:39.000
Cocona, Cocona!

00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:39.850
Next time!
